---
<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)]/40">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <!-- الجانب الأيسر: بطاقة الهوية -->
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-red mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">
          NEDL<span class="text-brand-red">/</span>SALAH
        </h3>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-red uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">
          Abu Dhabi, UAE • Hybrid Creative
        </p>
        
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
          Bridging the gap between visual aesthetics, clean code, and measurable marketing ROI. Founder of <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Orion Media</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--border-color)] space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="opacity-60">Languages:</span>
            <span>Arabic, English, French</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="opacity-60">Focus:</span>
            <span>Growth, Web & Branding</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- الجانب الأيمن: القصة المهنية -->
    <div class="md:col-span-7">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-red">About Me</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mt-2">
        Where Strategy Meets Execution.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 opacity-80 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p>
          Most brands struggle because their designer doesn't understand conversion, their developer doesn't understand marketing, and their marketer can't build assets quickly.
        </p>
        <p>
          With a background in <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Software Development</strong> and years of hands-on experience in <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Digital Marketing & Graphic Design</strong> in Abu Dhabi, I handle the entire digital lifecycle under one roof—from designing brand visuals and coding high-speed websites to scaling profitable ad campaigns.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>